message: "If you use this material, please cite it as below."
title: "IUCr Electron Crystallography School 2026 — companion website"
abstract: >-
  Companion website for the 2026 Electron Crystallography School, an IUCr
  satellite school held 8–10 August 2026 in Calgary, Canada, before the 27th
  Congress and General Assembly of the International Union of Crystallography.
  Collects the programme, the instructors, one page per lecture and practical
  demonstration, and the software and datasets used in the hands-on session.
type: dataset
